zxing/zxing-library-0.23.0.min.js
  @zxing/library 0.23.0, the ZXing barcode reader ported to TypeScript, by
  the ZXing contributors. Apache-2.0 licence (zxing/LICENSE). The package
  carries no NOTICE file.
  Source: https://registry.npmjs.org/@zxing/library/-/library-0.23.0.tgz
  (package/umd/index.min.js, package/LICENSE). It is the smallest UMD
  browser bundle that has the multi-format reader; it sets the global
  "ZXing". Change: none (the file has no sourceMappingURL line), only the
  name, which carries the version.
